| omega MolScribe-SwinB fine-tune + SMILES | 300 / 6 min | **49.40** (n=500) | likely ~0.05-0.08 s/img |
| altair MolScribe zero-shot + letterbox | - | **21.66** (n=96) | 0.071 s/img => 9.6 h (too slow to combine with training) |
